{"id": 57, "name": "Valir", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/9/9e/Hero571-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142021", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Damage", "Guard"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["20", "70", "70", "40"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Heir to Fire Throat, fire mage.", "skills": [{"name": "Ashing", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_65b74c606ad3b8d47f18b6f87bc25bee.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Valir's skills apply a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ablaze</span> to enemies hit, dealing them <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to 1<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+0.2% Total Magic Power)</span>% of their Max HP per second for 3s.\n\nAt 3 stacks, the fire detonates, dealing <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to 5<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+1% Total Magic Power)</span>% of the target's Max HP and stunning them for 1s (a target can only be stunned by Valir's skills once every 7s)."}, {"name": "Burst Fireball", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 1.5   Mana Cost: 45", "desc": "Valir launches a fireball that explodes upon hitting the first target, dealing 235<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+80% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The flame on the ground explodes after 1s, dealing 118<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\n\nValir recharges 1 fireball every 9s (up to 2 charges). Hitting an enemy hero or legend creep with this skill immediately restores 1 charge, while hitting a minion restores 4s of the recharge time.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Vengeance Flame</span>: Increases the cast range of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Burst Fireball</span> by 30%."}, {"name": "Searing Torrent", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d2289b367b7fb08328145563195346f6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 75", "desc": "Valir unleashes a torrent of flames in the target direction, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and knocking them back to the end of its path.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Vengeance Flame</span>: The torrent forms a firewall at the end of its path that lasts 4s, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies every 1s.\n\nEnemies hit by the torrent or the firewall are slowed by 25% for 1s."}, {"name": "Vengeance Flame", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_87bb3708c7ffb7391a768de2c82370a7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 64, "tagname": "Remove CC", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 36   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "Valir removes all debuffs on himself and gains 40% Movement Speed that decays over 3s. Meanwhile, he conjures 4 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Vengeance Flames</span> that enhance <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Burst Fireball</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Searing Torrent</span> for 9s."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/1